          "heading": "Fiji Rugby pursues vital development fees from major overseas professional clubs",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby is actively seeking development fees from overseas clubs to bolster its financial sustainability. Officials are prioritising these payments to better support local talent pathways as more players head abroad at a younger age. The initiative aims to ensure the union is adequately compensated when players nurtured within the Fijian system transition to professional environments internationally. This strategy is seen as a necessary step to protect the players and ensure the long-term health of the national programme."
