          "heading": "France World Cup squad workload agreement triggers fierce debate nationwide",
          "body": "The French federation and league governing body LNR faced intense scrutiny this week after a secret player workload agreement for next September's World Cup leaked to the media. The leaked plan outlines usage for 33 premium players, including mandatory rest periods and a nine-Test limit per season. The revelations sparked immediate consternation among Toulouse supporters concerned over their title tilt, alongside fan perplexity regarding the omissions of key personnel like Maxime Lucu and Greg Alldritt from the initial projections."
