          "body": "Ireland Under-20s full-back Noah Byrne has dealt Leinster and Irish rugby a major blow by rejecting a full academy contract to complete a move to AFL side Brisbane Lions. Byrne started every match of this year's Six Nations campaign and was heavily praised within the Leinster academy, but has opted to pursue an Australian rules career after previously playing minor football for Dublin."
