          "kicker": "WXV Global",
          "heading": "Italy women secure convincing victory over Japan in WXV opener",
          "body": "The Italy women's rugby team opened their WXV Global Series 2026 campaign with a resounding 55-21 victory against Japan at Stadio Omero Tognon. Captain Vittoria Ostuni Minuzzi earned her 50th cap and scored during the match, while Emma Stevanin, Aura Muzzo, Alessandra Frangipani, Alyssa D'Inca, Vittoria Vecchini and Giordana Duca also crossed for the Azzurre. Japan head coach Toshizumi Kitagawa said post-game, \"We had some positives like our attack in the opposition 22m, but we struggled to get into that area during the game.\""
