          "heading": "Darcy Graham ruled out of Scotland autumn Tests with bicep injury",
          "body": "Scotland and Edinburgh have suffered a major setback after winger Darcy Graham was ruled out for a minimum of 12 weeks with a ruptured bicep. Edinburgh head coach Sean Everitt revealed that the 29-year-old sustained the injury during a friendly against Harlequins, meaning he will miss November's home Tests against New Zealand, Australia and Japan. \"That's not good news for us and not good news for him, especially with the autumn series coming up,\" Everitt said."
