          "heading": "Les Kiss prepares to shift Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to the wing",
          "body": "Wallabies coach Les Kiss is reportedly set to move outside centre Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to the wing for Sunday’s Test against the Springboks in Perth. The switch would mark the first time the 23-year-old has started a Test anywhere other than outside centre since switching to rugby union in late 2024. Suaalii’s aerial ability is expected to be a key factor behind the decision as Australia prepare to combat South Africa’s contested kicking game, with Hunter Paisami likely to start at inside centre and Len Ikitau returning to No 13."
