          "body": "The Brave Blossoms secured their first Pacific Nations Cup title since 2019 by defeating holders Fiji 20-15 in a physical Test match at Prince Chichibu Memorial Stadium. Captain Naoto Saito described the victory as a great breakthrough to create history for Japan, noting that it gives the young team great confidence after falling short in the previous two finals. The win lifts Japan into the World Rugby top 10 rankings as they sit ninth."
